  "validation_notes": [
    "A first desktop hover test sampled a still-interpolating hit pose; the fixture now waits for its visual pose before targeting the health marker.",
    "The terrain colour lifecycle check uses Mobile with --ei-baked-terrain, as required by that fixture.",
    "The Android native battle exposed the Mobile per-mesh decal limit. The final build composites the original arena marks onto the snow on Mobile and Compatibility, retaining their growth, visibility and lifetime.",
    "The Android fixture instruments only the launcher; 335 gameplay scripts and every native library match the production APK. The separate QA package and settings were restored; the normal game was not modified."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Runtime and rendering checks ran on Linux and Retroid Pocket 5. Windows and macOS exports were audited without native OS runtime tests. macOS is unsigned.",
    "Android validation covers the snowy expedition and previously qualified renderer workloads; it does not measure a complete campaign or every Android GPU.",
    "Browser checks cover startup, cached upgrades and localized wiki layouts, not a complete campaign.",
    "Trials balance measurements in arena-alliances-2026-10-17.json cover Standard difficulty and deterministic purchasing policies, not human win rates.",
    "Wiki portraits are illustrative. Planning does not mutate actual gameplay saves or inventory."
  ],
  "deployment_verification": "Live asset hashes and browser rendering must pass before publishing the draft release; publication receipts remain in the release workspace."
